  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Communities for Improved Governance and Poverty Eradication in Teso Sub-Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to empower the grassroots communities in six sub-counties in Amuria and Katakwi Districts so they can engage local governance institutions and systems demanding open and transparent decision making, accountability and improved service delivery. To enable the grassroots communities to voice their interests, concerns and engage with policy formulation to demand accountability, transparency and democratic decision making at all levels of local governance.</narrative>
  </description>
